      },
      "payload": {
        "progress": "Root cause confirmed: newTicketId() uses real (unseeded) randomness via ulid's monotonicFactory; drawing 500 real ids and checking shortTicketCode (sha256(id) mod 36^5) for zero collisions hits the birthday paradox at ~0.2% per run (n=500, N=60.5M: P~=n^2/2N). Fixed by seeding a LOCAL monotonicFactory(mulberry32(seed)) with explicit strictly-increasing seed-times (never Date.now()) for this one test, making id generation fully reproducible while shortTicketCode itself stays exercised unchanged. Verified deterministic via 5 repeated runs, plus full suite (1907 tests) green."
      },
      "at": "2026-07-24T21:12:11.630Z"
    },
